        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin COT-RAR, Cottonwood Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Cottonwood Handleset features the Fleur De Lis made popular by the historic city of New Orleans. The Fleur De Lis Cottonwood Handleset has a covered deadbolt for an authentic look. It is available in either a dark bronze (pictured) or a white bronze finish. The Cottonwood Handleset will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors with 1-3/4 inch - 2-1/2 inch thicknesses. The adjustable latch allows it to fit 2-3/8 inch backsets as well as 2-3/4 inch backsets. A grade 2 lock, it is backed by a lifetime warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Bronze Cottonwood Fleur De Lis Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Cottonwood Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 20-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 11-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>5-1/2\" center to center bore</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fleur De Lis Cottonwood Handleset with Arched Interior Trim, Baldwin COT-RAR",
                "description": "Baldwin COT-RAR, Fleur De Lis Cottonwood Handleset with Arched Interior Trim - The Cottonwood Handleset features the Fleur De Lis made popular by the historic city of New Orleans. The Fleur De Lis Cottonwood Handleset has a covered deadbolt for an authentic look. It is available in either a dark bronze or a white bronze finish. The Cottonwood Handleset will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors with 1-3/4 inch - 2-1/2 inch thicknesses. The adjustable latch allows it to fit 2-3/8 inch backsets as well as 2-3/4 inch backsets. A grade 2 lock, it is backed by a lifetime warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions.",
                "keywords": "Baldwin COT-RAR, Fleur De Lis Cottonwood Handleset with Arched Interior Trim, Fleur De Lis Handlesets, covered deadbolt handlesets, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Cottonwood Entrance Sets, BAL-COT-RAR, Cottonwood Handlesets, Bronze Cottonwood Fleur De Lis Entrysets, Baldwin Reserve Collection Cottonwood Handlesets,"
